WEBVTT

00:00:00.640 --> 00:00:01.520
Let's go.

00:00:05.700 --> 00:00:09.870
Reginaaaa!

00:00:10.590 --> 00:00:11.560
This way!

00:00:14.490 --> 00:00:18.030
You shall not escape!

00:00:20.990 --> 00:00:23.990
Precures!

00:00:29.180 --> 00:00:30.580
Welcome back.

00:00:30.970 --> 00:00:33.300
Your safe return is what's most important.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:35.280
Nice to be back...

00:00:35.880 --> 00:00:38.850
We have to find a way to save the princess.

00:00:39.550 --> 00:00:42.020
To wake a princess from her slumber,

00:00:42.370 --> 00:00:44.490
you need a kiss from a prince, right?

00:00:45.150 --> 00:00:47.170
Joe, if you'd please!

00:00:47.510 --> 00:00:48.130
Huh?

00:00:48.760 --> 00:00:49.870
You mean me?

00:01:01.970 --> 00:01:01.980
{OP}

00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:08.200
Happy go lucky girls! Precure! Yeah!

00:01:08.200 --> 00:01:10.660
The world is like a merry-go-round

00:01:11.030 --> 00:01:13.530
Love makes it turn, 3, 2, 1

00:01:13.830 --> 00:01:15.570
Every day it sparkles

00:01:15.740 --> 00:01:19.270
Dokidoki Precure

00:01:20.740 --> 00:01:26.140
I wear my new clothes and walk a path I've never walked before

00:01:26.730 --> 00:01:31.800
My heart races and I greet the scenery around me

00:01:31.970 --> 00:01:37.440
The color of the flower on the corner will be my lucky color for the day

00:01:37.970 --> 00:01:42.890
Leave it all to me, because today I'm blessed

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:48.590
If your friends are in trouble

00:01:48.790 --> 00:01:57.470
isn't it normal to help them?

00:01:57.460 --> 00:01:59.130
Happy lucky Precure

00:01:59.120 --> 00:02:01.540
Only Precure makes my heart pound

00:02:01.780 --> 00:02:04.380
Our happy love will change the world

00:02:04.650 --> 00:02:07.180
What's more than just cute

00:02:07.490 --> 00:02:11.060
is our promise between girls

00:02:11.860 --> 00:02:17.100
I will fight for you and believe in you

00:02:17.130 --> 00:02:23.000
Gather your unparalleled tenderness, yeah, Precure

00:02:39.110 --> 00:02:41.330
It didn't do anything!

00:02:41.330 --> 00:02:44.150
I guess it doesn't work the way it does in fairy tales.

00:02:45.470 --> 00:02:46.380
How embarrassing!

00:02:46.380 --> 00:02:47.310
This is serious!

00:02:47.680 --> 00:02:50.700
This isn't your ordinary ice.

00:02:50.700 --> 00:02:55.460
Princess Ann may have frozen herself in this to protect herself from harm.

00:02:55.740 --> 00:02:58.360
In that case, it won't be easy to get her out.

00:02:58.700 --> 00:03:00.680
Then what should we do?

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:04.670
The Selfish will certainly return to snatch her away.

00:03:05.540 --> 00:03:09.170
How about we hide her until she awakens?

00:03:09.160 --> 00:03:10.260
Huh?

00:03:10.260 --> 00:03:11.640
But where?

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:16.540
Sorry, but I'd have to keep it a secret from you.

00:03:17.580 --> 00:03:19.540
It'd be safer that way.

00:03:21.140 --> 00:03:22.250
Are you coming with?

00:03:23.950 --> 00:03:24.980
Great.

00:03:24.980 --> 00:03:27.220
I'll leave the rest to you.

00:03:27.570 --> 00:03:28.410
Right!

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:36.700
Arriving In The Nick Of Time!

00:03:32.090 --> 00:03:36.700
Arriving In The Nick Of Time!

00:03:38.150 --> 00:03:39.450
Now then,

00:03:39.450 --> 00:03:42.640
the princess is safe for now...

00:03:46.780 --> 00:03:48.440
What should I do now?

00:03:49.080 --> 00:03:50.410
Regina...

00:03:50.700 --> 00:03:55.580
We really made Daddy mad by doing what we did.

00:03:56.420 --> 00:03:59.790
And a "sorry" won't cut it with him.

00:04:03.140 --> 00:04:05.990
Regina, do you love your dad?

00:04:06.300 --> 00:04:06.970
Huh?

00:04:08.190 --> 00:04:09.070
Yeah...

00:04:09.400 --> 00:04:12.060
Even after what he did to you?

00:04:12.060 --> 00:04:15.160
But he's my daddy.

00:04:15.160 --> 00:04:16.140
I see.

00:04:16.950 --> 00:04:19.610
Well, I love you too.

00:04:21.190 --> 00:04:23.450
Back when you saved me,

00:04:24.140 --> 00:04:26.850
your kindness shone through to me.

00:04:27.350 --> 00:04:28.910
I was so happy!

00:04:28.910 --> 00:04:32.720
I could tell how you felt, too.

00:04:33.640 --> 00:04:36.560
Thank you for saving Mana.

00:04:37.030 --> 00:04:38.290
Makopi!

00:04:38.730 --> 00:04:40.730
Thank you, Regina.

00:04:40.730 --> 00:04:42.900
I could tell as well.

00:04:45.120 --> 00:04:45.690
See?

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:49.730
We all saw how much you loved us!

00:04:49.730 --> 00:04:52.870
So I'm sure your dad can understand, too!

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:00.420
So, let's go home!

00:05:00.410 --> 00:05:02.800
Huh? What home?

00:05:02.800 --> 00:05:04.840
I can't go back to min—

00:05:05.280 --> 00:05:06.990
To my house!

00:05:11.920 --> 00:05:13.460
So, what I'm asking is...

00:05:13.990 --> 00:05:15.940
please let her stay over for a while!

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:17.550
Pretty please!

00:05:18.830 --> 00:05:20.140
Pretty please.

00:05:23.020 --> 00:05:25.480
Bein' a good samaritan again?

00:05:25.480 --> 00:05:26.600
Yeah...

00:05:26.600 --> 00:05:28.010
You never quit...

00:05:28.530 --> 00:05:31.830
Mana really takes after a certain someone.

00:05:31.830 --> 00:05:33.150
You've got that right.

00:05:34.510 --> 00:05:36.280
Regina, was it?

00:05:36.280 --> 00:05:36.960
Yes.

00:05:37.870 --> 00:05:40.130
You look kinda down.

00:05:40.920 --> 00:05:43.600
Times like these call for food!

00:05:45.720 --> 00:05:47.500
Now, bon appétit!

00:05:52.720 --> 00:05:53.840
It's yummy!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.410
I know, right?

00:05:55.410 --> 00:05:58.240
Daddy's omelette rice always perks you up!

00:05:59.280 --> 00:06:01.800
I say it's got a long way to go!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:02.830
Oh?

00:06:02.830 --> 00:06:06.370
I think it's already better than what you make, Dad.

00:06:06.370 --> 00:06:07.080
What?!

00:06:07.570 --> 00:06:08.990
Settle down.

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:12.270
We can have Regina be the judge next time!

00:06:12.270 --> 00:06:13.590
Huh? Me?

00:06:14.290 --> 00:06:15.360
Very well!

00:06:15.350 --> 00:06:18.150
Regina won't play favorites for you!

00:06:18.150 --> 00:06:22.400
It takes more than marriage to get a compliment from Ayumi!

00:06:22.400 --> 00:06:24.040
Don't be so sure!

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:30.000
She got you, Daddy!

00:06:32.980 --> 00:06:34.490
<i>It's strange...</i>

00:06:34.490 --> 00:06:37.760
<i>Watching them makes me feel warm and fuzzy.</i>

00:06:39.050 --> 00:06:41.110
<i>But why...</i>

00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:45.860
<i>does my heart hurt in spite of that?</i>

00:06:49.070 --> 00:06:50.990
Wow, you're so cute!

00:06:51.360 --> 00:06:53.140
Aw, you think so?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.740
Not more than me, though.

00:06:55.640 --> 00:06:57.200
I guess...

00:06:58.310 --> 00:06:59.540
What's up?

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:01.560
Well...

00:07:02.930 --> 00:07:07.420
I was just thinking that I didn't have any memories with Daddy.

00:07:08.140 --> 00:07:11.090
You didn't go out much with your dad?

00:07:11.600 --> 00:07:13.070
Maybe...

00:07:13.070 --> 00:07:15.040
You don't remember?

00:07:15.040 --> 00:07:15.780
No.

00:07:16.330 --> 00:07:18.150
When I try to remember,

00:07:18.150 --> 00:07:20.700
my head just goes all fuzzy.

00:07:20.970 --> 00:07:22.860
How weird...

00:07:22.860 --> 00:07:26.990
Well, now's your chance to make new ones with him!

00:07:27.470 --> 00:07:28.570
Now?

00:07:29.530 --> 00:07:31.600
But I made him mad...

00:07:32.370 --> 00:07:34.260
We already told you.

00:07:34.260 --> 00:07:37.440
He'll understand how much you love him!

00:07:37.440 --> 00:07:38.740
Maybe...

00:07:38.740 --> 00:07:40.250
Definitely!

00:07:40.250 --> 00:07:44.360
Your feelings shone through to us, after all!

00:07:44.360 --> 00:07:46.450
I know your dad will understand!

00:07:48.180 --> 00:07:49.100
Okay!

00:07:49.100 --> 00:07:51.260
Once you're feeling better, I'll go with you!

00:07:51.260 --> 00:07:51.990
Huh?

00:07:52.430 --> 00:07:55.290
I'll help you tell your dad how you feel!

00:07:56.480 --> 00:07:57.050
Sure!

00:07:59.090 --> 00:08:01.100
Okay, lights out!

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:11.980
I'll sleep with you! {Nothing lewd here whatsoever. Get your head out of the gutter.}

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:29.940
Just when I thought we were rid of that spoiled brat,

00:08:29.940 --> 00:08:32.320
he tells us to go looking for her?

00:08:32.320 --> 00:08:35.130
King Selfish is way too selfish!

00:08:35.460 --> 00:08:37.960
But this makes it interesting.

00:08:38.500 --> 00:08:39.160
How?

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:43.490
The Precures have begun showing friendship to Regina.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.840
So, if she should once again be overcome by evil...

00:08:46.840 --> 00:08:48.990
My, that <i>does</i> sound like fun!

00:08:48.990 --> 00:08:51.350
That's our king of selfishness!

00:08:55.520 --> 00:08:57.120
Good morning!

00:08:57.540 --> 00:08:59.220
Morning!

00:09:04.690 --> 00:09:07.680
I don't think I've ever been on a picnic before.

00:09:07.680 --> 00:09:09.260
Really?

00:09:09.260 --> 00:09:11.690
It's been forever for me, too!

00:09:21.210 --> 00:09:23.350
Hello, beach!

00:09:23.340 --> 00:09:25.770
And the weather's perfect!

00:09:26.380 --> 00:09:29.390
Last one on the sand's a rotten egg!

00:10:09.450 --> 00:10:12.030
Regina, did you like the picnic?

00:10:12.030 --> 00:10:14.490
Yeah, it was super fun!

00:10:15.140 --> 00:10:18.110
The sea's kind of calming...

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:19.460
Great!

00:10:20.600 --> 00:10:23.720
At times when I'm at a loss and don't know what to do,

00:10:23.720 --> 00:10:25.260
I come to the beach.

00:10:25.260 --> 00:10:26.770
Huh? You do?

00:10:27.050 --> 00:10:27.650
Yeah.

00:10:28.730 --> 00:10:33.110
I look at how the sea and sky go on forever, and think about this:

00:10:34.340 --> 00:10:36.650
The sea's connected to the sky.

00:10:37.290 --> 00:10:40.210
The sky's connected to the infinite universe.

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:43.860
My problems are a tiny speck in comparison,

00:10:43.860 --> 00:10:47.190
so I'll just take life one step at a time.

00:10:48.310 --> 00:10:51.410
Take life... one step at a time...

00:10:52.660 --> 00:10:55.970
Just kidding, but it sounded cool, right?

00:10:55.970 --> 00:10:57.100
I don't mind.

00:10:57.100 --> 00:10:59.400
You can be cool sometimes, Daddy!

00:10:59.400 --> 00:11:03.890
That must be what Mana's mother loved about you.

00:11:03.890 --> 00:11:05.180
Hey now....

00:11:13.150 --> 00:11:15.320
<i>My heart feels so warm again...</i>

00:11:16.770 --> 00:11:19.250
<i>But... it hurts.</i>

00:11:21.680 --> 00:11:23.000
Okay, it's set!

00:11:25.890 --> 00:11:26.450
Mana!

00:11:30.050 --> 00:11:31.250
You all right?

00:11:31.250 --> 00:11:32.840
Yeah, thanks.

00:11:33.180 --> 00:11:35.310
Guess that comes from being Mana's dad.

00:11:36.470 --> 00:11:41.240
<i>I hope I can be that close with my daddy...</i>

00:11:41.830 --> 00:11:43.690
Found ya.

00:12:03.780 --> 00:12:06.280
Regina, it's time to go home.

00:12:06.280 --> 00:12:08.510
King Selfish is waiting for you.

00:12:09.090 --> 00:12:10.180
Daddy?

00:12:12.230 --> 00:12:15.210
But... I don't want to go home right now.

00:12:15.210 --> 00:12:16.980
Shut up and come with us. {alt. "Shut up and get in the car."}

00:12:16.980 --> 00:12:18.540
Who are you people?

00:12:18.540 --> 00:12:20.320
Not someone humans oughta mess with!

00:12:21.380 --> 00:12:22.200
Daddy!

00:12:23.200 --> 00:12:24.630
Where's Princess Ann?

00:12:24.620 --> 00:12:26.830
You expect us to tell people like you?!

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:29.040
Good grief.

00:12:29.040 --> 00:12:32.000
It seems we'll need to do this the hard way.

00:12:32.510 --> 00:12:35.310
He's all right, he just lost consciousness.

00:12:37.030 --> 00:12:38.500
Girls, let's go!

00:12:39.430 --> 00:12:41.280
Charles!

00:12:42.490 --> 00:12:45.210
Precure Love Link!

00:12:46.290 --> 00:12:47.080
L-O-V-E!

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:47.870
L-O-V-E!

00:12:47.870 --> 00:12:48.630
L-O-V-E!

00:12:48.630 --> 00:12:49.770
L-O-V-E!

00:13:12.680 --> 00:13:14.090
Brimming with love,

00:13:14.800 --> 00:13:16.220
Cure Heart!

00:13:19.040 --> 00:13:20.480
The light of wisdom,

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.000
Cure Diamond!

00:13:25.200 --> 00:13:27.020
The warmth of the sun,

00:13:27.930 --> 00:13:29.420
Cure Rosetta!

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.140
The blade of courage,

00:13:32.960 --> 00:13:34.340
Cure Sword!

00:13:37.690 --> 00:13:40.080
Listen to the heartbeat of love!

00:13:40.080 --> 00:13:41.750
Dokidoki Precure!

00:13:43.600 --> 00:13:45.870
Oh poor Selfishes who have lost their love,

00:13:46.380 --> 00:13:48.040
I, Cure Heart,

00:13:48.030 --> 00:13:51.580
will make your hearts race once more!

00:13:52.060 --> 00:13:53.040
Let's go.

00:14:01.450 --> 00:14:02.440
Mana!

00:14:08.560 --> 00:14:11.320
Precure Rosetta Reflection!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:21.640
Look out, Mana!

00:14:24.740 --> 00:14:27.270
Mana! Girls!

00:14:28.860 --> 00:14:31.420
Why... does my chest hurt?

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:33.960
It's just like the pain earlier...

00:14:34.730 --> 00:14:35.800
Why?

00:14:36.890 --> 00:14:40.760
It is because you know love.

00:14:49.100 --> 00:14:49.800
Daddy!

00:14:53.870 --> 00:14:54.740
It can't be...

00:14:55.300 --> 00:14:57.450
Has King Selfish been resurrected?

00:14:57.940 --> 00:14:58.910
No...

00:14:59.480 --> 00:15:00.820
That's...

00:15:00.820 --> 00:15:03.720
A projection of King Selfish!

00:15:10.150 --> 00:15:10.790
Regina!

00:15:11.330 --> 00:15:13.160
Give Regina back!

00:15:14.860 --> 00:15:16.060
Regina!

00:15:16.060 --> 00:15:17.000
Regina!

00:15:17.000 --> 00:15:18.060
Regina!

00:15:18.060 --> 00:15:20.340
Come back, Regina!

00:15:23.550 --> 00:15:24.410
Daddy...

00:15:25.500 --> 00:15:26.780
Regina...

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:31.110
Love has budded within your heart.

00:15:31.750 --> 00:15:35.380
All because of your acquaintance with those Precures.

00:15:35.830 --> 00:15:39.210
That is what pains and torments your heart so.

00:15:40.140 --> 00:15:41.850
I have love?

00:15:41.850 --> 00:15:46.530
Do away with such foolish emotions and return home.

00:15:51.200 --> 00:15:52.490
No.

00:15:52.490 --> 00:15:55.690
You said I was no daughter of yours!

00:15:55.690 --> 00:15:56.810
I hate you, Daddy!

00:15:58.900 --> 00:16:00.510
I apologize...

00:16:00.510 --> 00:16:01.340
Huh?

00:16:01.910 --> 00:16:03.700
Forgive me.

00:16:03.700 --> 00:16:06.480
I need you.

00:16:07.040 --> 00:16:07.960
Me?

00:16:08.330 --> 00:16:12.020
Yes, my adorable daughter.

00:16:12.020 --> 00:16:14.420
My one and only Regina...

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:15.820
Daddy...

00:16:20.950 --> 00:16:22.620
But I...

00:16:22.620 --> 00:16:24.810
I like Mana and her friends, too!

00:16:24.810 --> 00:16:26.780
I don't know what to do!

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:29.340
You poor thing...

00:16:29.340 --> 00:16:31.980
Worry not, Regina.

00:16:32.710 --> 00:16:34.870
If you have more Egogy,

00:16:34.870 --> 00:16:37.940
your pain will vanish, and you shall grow stronger.

00:16:38.940 --> 00:16:39.910
Egogy?

00:16:40.280 --> 00:16:43.350
Now, accept it.

00:16:43.350 --> 00:16:47.350
It is a present from me to you.

00:16:56.500 --> 00:16:57.730
It's true...

00:16:57.730 --> 00:16:59.540
the pain is vanishing!

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:01.940
But...

00:17:22.810 --> 00:17:25.650
I really do love you, Daddy.

00:17:25.650 --> 00:17:28.430
But the ones who tore me from him...

00:17:29.810 --> 00:17:30.770
are the Precures!

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:42.370
Regina!

00:17:51.800 --> 00:17:53.820
I feel like a new woman!

00:17:54.390 --> 00:17:55.490
Regina?

00:17:57.280 --> 00:17:58.650
I'll erase you.

00:18:02.390 --> 00:18:03.870
Whoah!

00:18:03.870 --> 00:18:08.070
That is the strength King Selfish bestowed upon her.

00:18:12.460 --> 00:18:14.610
Regina... what happened?

00:18:14.610 --> 00:18:16.250
I think...

00:18:16.250 --> 00:18:19.570
King Selfish infused her with his wicked energy!

00:18:19.570 --> 00:18:21.350
All to keep her back in line.

00:18:22.180 --> 00:18:23.510
That's evil...

00:18:23.510 --> 00:18:24.760
Horrendously so!

00:18:25.780 --> 00:18:26.720
And Regina...

00:18:27.530 --> 00:18:29.590
loved her dad so much...

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:32.190
I will not...

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:34.930
let King Selfish have his way!

00:18:35.250 --> 00:18:36.980
What are you talking about?

00:18:36.980 --> 00:18:40.760
Nothing in the world matters besides me and Daddy.

00:18:40.760 --> 00:18:42.960
That doesn't include you, so begone!

00:18:50.990 --> 00:18:52.540
Regina...

00:18:52.540 --> 00:18:53.720
Listen to me!

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:56.050
I don't need you anymore.

00:18:56.040 --> 00:18:58.450
But <i>I</i> need you!

00:18:58.450 --> 00:18:59.950
Regina...

00:18:59.950 --> 00:19:01.750
you're one of my best friends!

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:03.100
Friend?

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:04.730
Indeed.

00:19:04.730 --> 00:19:06.920
We are all friends!

00:19:07.280 --> 00:19:10.800
Did you forget when Cure Heart saved you?

00:19:12.540 --> 00:19:15.800
Back then, even I had thought...

00:19:15.800 --> 00:19:18.170
that you truly wanted to be our friend!

00:19:18.790 --> 00:19:21.180
You have to find those feelings again!

00:19:21.180 --> 00:19:22.190
Regina!

00:19:22.190 --> 00:19:23.430
Regina!

00:19:23.430 --> 00:19:24.550
Regina!

00:19:27.260 --> 00:19:28.720
But I <i>know</i> now.

00:19:28.720 --> 00:19:31.440
All this mushy friendship garbage...

00:19:32.130 --> 00:19:34.450
was part of your plan to hurt me!

00:19:34.450 --> 00:19:35.380
No!

00:19:35.380 --> 00:19:36.450
That's not it at all!

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.440
Too bad!

00:19:38.440 --> 00:19:41.280
I'm not falling for that trick twice!

00:19:48.800 --> 00:19:50.900
What should... we do?

00:19:53.160 --> 00:19:55.150
If we use a Lovely Force Arrow,

00:19:55.150 --> 00:19:57.550
it could cleanse the evil in her heart!

00:19:59.830 --> 00:20:01.320
Let's try it.

00:20:02.220 --> 00:20:02.850
Mana!

00:20:03.900 --> 00:20:04.680
I know.

00:20:05.670 --> 00:20:10.120
Precure Lovely Force Arrow!

00:20:33.150 --> 00:20:34.490
Cure Heart?

00:20:35.530 --> 00:20:36.910
I...

00:20:36.910 --> 00:20:38.120
just can't do it!

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:40.460
You fools.

00:20:51.530 --> 00:20:52.930
Girls...

00:20:52.930 --> 00:20:54.210
are you all right?

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:55.500
Hang in there!

00:20:57.290 --> 00:20:59.970
I think it's time to end this.

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:08.120
Farewell Precures, you faux-warriors of love!

00:21:08.430 --> 00:21:09.710
Regina...

00:21:09.710 --> 00:21:10.580
stop it!

00:21:11.550 --> 00:21:13.740
Regina!

00:21:14.660 --> 00:21:16.440
Kyupirappa!

00:21:51.660 --> 00:21:53.500
Who are you?

00:21:54.860 --> 00:21:56.450
Love's trump card,

00:21:59.370 --> 00:22:00.870
Cure Ace!

00:22:04.970 --> 00:22:05.010
{ED}

00:22:07.570 --> 00:22:11.080
I am love's trump card, Cure Ace!

00:22:11.080 --> 00:22:12.080
Cure Ace?

00:22:12.080 --> 00:22:14.180
A new Precure?

00:22:14.180 --> 00:22:16.810
To be capable of nullifying Regina's attacks...

00:22:16.810 --> 00:22:18.180
She must be powerful!

00:22:18.180 --> 00:22:20.520
Please do not be alarmed by such trivialities.

00:22:21.020 --> 00:22:25.860
I'm here to help you all reach the next stage as Precures!

00:22:26.790 --> 00:22:27.760
<i>Dokidoki Precure</i>:

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.830
Taking Love Back!

00:22:28.490 --> 00:22:31.830
Taking Love Back!

00:22:31.830 --> 00:22:34.000
That knot in your heart won't come undone!
